# Copy checklist: facts only the owner can supply

`AGENTS.md` forbids an invented owner fact, a client name, a metric, a testimonial or a credential. A fact the owner has not given becomes `TODO(owner)` in the copy and a row here. Fill the `Answer` column. A claim ships only when its row is marked `confirmed`; a blank row stays off the site.

